    <!-- 卡片底色与行底色取自小爱课程表组件：4×2 底 #F6F8FC，2×2 纯白，行白，进行中 #E7F3FF，即将上课 #FEEFEF -->
    <color name="widget_bg">#FFF6F8FC</color>
    <color name="widget_bg_small">#FFFFFFFF</color>
    <color name="widget_divider">#FFFFFFFF</color>
    <color name="widget_header_text">#80000000</color>
    <color name="widget_empty_text">#80000000</color>
    <color name="widget_time_text">#80000000</color>
    <color name="widget_time_sub_text">#4D000000</color>
    <color name="widget_title_text">#E6000000</color>
    <color name="widget_subtitle_text">#4D000000</color>
    <color name="widget_subtle_text">#4D000000</color>
